### Finding 2.4 — Docker Compose Missing Memory Limits [LOW] ✅ FIXED

**Fix:** Added `mem_limit` and `memswap_limit` to both `app` and `worker` services in `docker-compose.yml`. Configurable via `APP_MEM_LIMIT`/`WORKER_MEM_LIMIT` env vars with sensible defaults (512m/1g).

Also added `LEMNISCATE_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` to the worker service environment (was missing).

